			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"Arrangers: Marika Suzuki, Kota Suzuki, Akihiko Narita, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Akiyuki Morimoto, Azusa Kato, Yoshiya Terayama, Zhenlan Kang\r\nPerformers: Ayaka Fukuhara, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada\r\nSound Director / Sound Designer: Ryo Yoshii\r\nLyricist: Masakazu Eguchi"
				"french"		"Composition et arrangements : Marika Suzuki\r\nInterprétations et enregistrements additionnels : Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita et Azusa Kato\r\nAudio additionnel : Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nParoles additionnelles : Masakazu Eguchi"
				"italian"		"Composizione e arrangiamento di Marika Suzuki\r\nAltri arrangiamenti e interpretazioni di Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita e Azusa Kato\r\nAltro audio di Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nAltri testi di Masakazu Eguchi\r\n"
				"german"		"Komponiert und arrangiert von Marika Suzuki\r\nZusätzliche Arrangements und Darbietungen von Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita und Azusa Kato\r\n\r\nZusätzlicher Sound von Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nZusätzliche Liedtexte von Masakazu Eguchi"
				"arabic"		"تم تأليفها وتوزيعها بواسطة Marika Suzuki\r\nالتوزيعات الإضافية والأداء بواسطة Ayaka Fukuhara وYasumasa Kitagawa وZhenlan Kang وAkiyuki Morimoto وShinya 'Midnight' Okada وKota Suzuki وYoshiya Terayama وAkihiko Narita وAzusa Kato\r\n\r\nالصوت الإضافي بواسطة Ryo Yoshii وYasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nكلمات الأغاني الإضافية بواسطة Masakazu Eguchi"
				"bulgarian"		""
				"czech"		""
				"danish"		"Komponeret og arrangeret af Marika Suzuki\r\nYderligere arrangementer og opførelser af Ayaka Fykuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, og Azusa Kato\r\nYderligere musik af Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nYderligere tekst af Masakazu Eguchi"
				"dutch"		"Gecomponeerd en gearrangeerd: Marika Suzuki\r\nAdditionele arrangementen en uitvoeringe: Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, en Azusa Kato\r\nAdditioneel geluid: Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nAdditionele teksten: Masakazu Eguchi"
				"finnish"		"Sävellys ja sovitus: Marika Suzuki\r\nMuut sovitukset ja esitykset: Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya ”Midnight” Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita ja Azusa Kato\r\nMuut äänet: Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nMuut sanoitukset: Masakazu Eguchi"
				"greek"		""
				"hungarian"		""
				"japanese"		"Arrangers：鈴木 まり香, 北川 保昌、康 貞蘭、森本 章之、鈴木 幸太、寺山 善也、成田 暁彦、加藤 あずさ\r\nVocal：福原 綾香\r\nWords：江口 正和\r\nKeyboard：Shinya 'Midnight' Okada\r\nPre Mastering：森口 崇\r\nSound Manager：米澤 保幸\r\nSound Director /Sound Designer：吉井 亮"
				"koreana"		"Composed and arranged by Marika Suzuki\r\nAdditional arrangements and performances by Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, and Azusa Kato\r\nAdditional sound by Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nAdditional lyrics by Masakazu Eguchi"
				"norwegian"		"Komponert og arrangert av Marika Suzuki\r\nEkstra arrangement og fremføring av Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya «Midnight» Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita og Azusa Kato\r\nEkstra lyd av Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nEkstra tekst av Masakazu Eguchi"
				"polish"		"Kompozycja i aranżacja: Marika Suzuki\r\nDodatkowe aranżacje i wykonawcy: Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita oraz Azusa Kato.\r\nDodatkowe udźwiękowienie: Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nDodatkowe teksty: Masakazu Eguchi"
				"portuguese"		"Composição e arranjos de Marika Suzuki\r\nArranjos adicionais e interpretação de Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita e Azusa Kato\r\nSom adicional de Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nLetras adicionais de Masakazu Eguchi"
				"brazilian"		"Composições e arranjos por Marika Suzuki\r\nArranjos adicionais e performances por Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita e Azusa Kato\r\nSom adicional por Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nLetras adicionais por Masakazu Eguchi"
				"romanian"		""
				"russian"		"Музыка и аранжировка: Marika Suzuki\r\nПри участии: Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita и Azusa Kato\r\nДополнительный звук: Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nДополнительный текст: Masakazu Eguchi"
				"schinese"		"Composed and arranged by Marika Suzuki\r\nAdditional arrangements and performances by Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, and Azusa Kato\r\nAdditional sound by Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nAdditional lyrics by Masakazu Eguchi"
				"latam"		""
				"spanish"		"Marika Suzuki tarafından bestelenmiş ve düzenlenmiştir\r\nEk aranjmanlar ve performanslar: Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, ve Azusa Kato\r\nEk ses: Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nEk sözler: Masakazu Eguchi"
				"swedish"		"Skrivna och arrangerade av Marika Suzuki\r\nÖvriga arrangemang och framföranden av Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, och Azusa Kato\r\nÖvriga ljud av Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nÖvriga sångtexter av Masakazu Eguchi"
				"thai"		""
				"tchinese"		"Composed and arranged by Marika Suzuki\r\nAdditional arrangements and performances by Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, and Azusa Kato\r\nAdditional sound by Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nAdditional lyrics by Masakazu Eguchi"
				"turkish"		"Marika Suzuki tarafından bestelenmiş ve düzenlenmiştir\r\nEk aranjmanlar ve performanslar: Ayaka Fukuhara, Yasumasa Kitagawa, Zhenlan Kang, Akiyuki Morimoto, Shinya 'Midnight' Okada, Kota Suzuki, Yoshiya Terayama, Akihiko Narita, ve Azusa Kato\r\nEk ses: Ryo Yoshii, Yasuyuki Yonezawa\r\nEk sözler: Masakazu Eguchi"
